libtool for building Apache 2.0 on OS/390

Installation of this libtool on OS/390:

1) unpack the tarball via pax since the contents are ASCII
2) make
3) export LIBTOOL_PREFIX=xxx     (e.g., /usr/local)
4) make install

Building Apache on OS/390:

1) Please see http://www.apache.org/~trawick/apache-2-on-os390.html


